# Number of Swaths (N) is binding

User-requested Number of Swaths is BINDING. Engagement/ranking MUST NOT rewrite N.

Aled already fixed this. Do not "optimize" the count for a faster tour, even
swath pairs, leftover Swath Width, or engagement ranking. If the user asked
for N swaths, the plan has N adjacent bands (when there are at least N sail
lines). Those bands ARE how the route is mapped. Auto must not search other
values of N and must not permute swath-block order for time or engagement.

Regression: `node _live_deploy/test-route-solver.mjs`
